runningmanager (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package.
  * Linux frontend based on SDL2 and OpenGL 3.
  * Process list, search, sorting and actions powered by /proc and X11 EWMH.
  * System summary for CPU, memory, disk and supported GPUs.
  * Desktop entry, application icons and manual page.

